      "docs": "The block takes its words as props; the types sit at the top of the file. Name the theme in the same command, for example: npx shadcn@latest add https://midnight-lite.vilqor.com/r/midnight-theme.json https://midnight-lite.vilqor.com/r/midnight-footer.json. A theme that only comes in as a dependency adds its colours but keeps your existing --background, --primary and fonts. If the page is not night-blue, run: npx shadcn@latest add https://midnight-lite.vilqor.com/r/midnight-theme.json. Pass year as a number, such as 2026: new Date() breaks next build when cacheComponents is on. Works with the Radix and the Base UI styles of shadcn/ui; React Aria (aria-nova) is not supported yet.\nThe full Midnight template, with seven more sections, forms and analytics: https://templates.vilqor.com/midnight?ref=shadcn"
    }
  ]
